  "details": "Description\n\nAs of the newest update, you are currently unable to manipulate in-world menus with actions that require the dragging of a mouse. Things such as changing the volume of a video player, scrolling an in-world menu, moving a slider, and more, are currently just not working at all. Whatever the new update has done for desktop, it has affected a majority of worlds.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nPlay the game on desktop mode, and attempt to adjust the volume of an in-world video player, or scroll down an in-game menu in a game world- such as FISH!, for example.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: World\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1919-27c41b24d2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-04_07-50-41.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_3541eef8-d7c1-4552-84ea-ac243d0f9f4e/1/file)",
